dialect protocol
protocol deflate.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.deflate.op
start op
framing record

# Real op frame (`dsl::variants_binary::encode_tagged_op`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag varint`,
# then the kind's framework record body (`os_pack::encode_record_body`). Each record is one mutation kind at its
# wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, which the codec looks up by the kind's keyword.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag varint
record set-snapshot tag=0
field payload bytes
record set-compression-params tag=1
field payload bytes
record set-preset-dictionary tag=2
field payload bytes
record set-payload tag=3
field payload bytes
